%% Object that is also a material: One thing seen two ways, for example an ingot that is also a portion of steel. As an object it has qualities that scale with its size (mass); as a material it has qualities that do not (chemical composition).

    Material["<b>Material</b><br>PMD_0000000 material<br><br>e.g. steel"]:::local
    Workpiece["<b>Object</b><br>BFO_0000030 object<br><br>e.g. an ingot"]:::local
    Mass["<b>Mass</b><br>PMD_0020133 mass"]:::local
    Composition["<b>Composition</b><br>PMD_0000551 chemical composition"]:::local

    Material --> Workpiece
    Workpiece -. "has quality<br>RO_0000086" .-> Mass
    Workpiece -. "has quality<br>RO_0000086" .-> Composition

    classDef local fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f172a

